fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266ScalingList","fragment":"\n\tGstH266ScalingList\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266ScalingList\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266ScalingList\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 scaling list parameters.\nspecifies whether the values of the scaling list are the\nsame as the values of a reference scaling list.\nspecifies whether the values of the scaling list can be\npredicted from a reference scaling list.\nspecifies the reference scaling list used to derive the\npredicted scaling matrix scalingMatrixPred.\nused to derive the value of the variable ScalingMatrixDcRec.\nspecifies the difference between the current matrix coefficient\nScalingList.\nthe scaling list DC coef.\nthe calculated scaling list coefs.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 scaling list parameters.\nspecifies whether the values of the scaling list are the\nsame as the values of a reference scaling list.\nspecifies whether the values of the scaling list can be\npredicted from a reference scaling list.\nspecifies the reference scaling list used to derive the\npredicted scaling matrix scalingMatrixPred.\nused to derive the value of the variable ScalingMatrixDcRec.\nspecifies the difference between the current matrix coefficient\nScalingList.\nthe scaling list DC coef.\nthe calculated scaling list coefs.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 scaling list parameters.\nspecifies whether the values of the scaling list are the\nsame as the values of a reference scaling list.\nspecifies whether the values of the scaling list can be\npredicted from a reference scaling list.\nspecifies the reference scaling list used to derive the\npredicted scaling matrix scalingMatrixPred.\nused to derive the value of the variable ScalingMatrixDcRec.\nspecifies the difference between the current matrix coefficient\nScalingList.\nthe scaling list DC coef.\nthe calculated scaling list coefs.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1